    <statement><p>Find the intercepts of the plane <m>6 x+ y +7 z = 42.</m> <alert> Write your answers as points <m>(a,b,c)</m> where <m>a</m>, <m>b</m>, and <m>c</m> are numbers. </alert></p>
<p><alert> 1. </alert> The <m>x</m>-axis intercept.</p>
<p>Answer: <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p><alert> 2. </alert> The <m>y</m>-axis intercept.</p>
<p>Answer: <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
<p><alert> 3. </alert> The <m>z</m>-axis intercept.</p>
<p>Answer: <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0003"/></p>
<p><alert> Note: </alert> <em> If there is no intersection, write "none".</em></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left(7,0,0\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
